Rule 37 (tensor has at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 38 (if k is negative, then tensor is 2D)
{v_1 : tensor, k : int} |= k < 0 ∧ ndim(v_1) = 2
